{"title":"CALMA COLLECTION","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom elegant natural wood grains to intricate handcrafted inlays, every \u003cstrong\u003eCalma\u003c\/strong\u003e cue is a statement of quality and individuality. Whether you're a competitive player or a passionate collector, this collection offers cues that deliver professional-level performance while showcasing timeless craftsmanship.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"asset-pack-85615640578-example-product-3","title":"Wenge wood x Ahswood (Butt Only)","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eFeatures\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e15 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Ashwood handle for a clean, elegant appearance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRich Wenge wood forearm and butt sleeve with beautiful natural grain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGenuine abalone inlays that shimmer under light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision-machined Radial 3\/8×8 pin for a solid, consistent hit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandcrafted by experienced cue makers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent balance and feedback for competitive play\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh-gloss finish for durability and a luxurious look\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEach cue is unique due to the natural characteristics of the wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43435908825136,"sku":null,"price":30000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_28_2026_10_28_46_AM.png?v=1785205740"},{"product_id":"cm-002","title":"Ashwood x Wenge wood (Butt Only)","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eFeatures\u003cspa